  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/55/6"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/1"/>Seek Adonoy when He is accessible,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/2"/>call Him when He is near.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/3"/>Adonoy is near to all who call upon Him,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/4"/>to all who call upon Him in truth.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/19"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/5"/>Adonoy is close to the broken-hearted,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/6"/>and those crushed in spirit, He delivers.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/4/7"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/7"/>For what nation is there so great
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/8"/>that has God so near unto them,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/9"/>as Adonoy, our God
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/10"/>in all that we call upon Him?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/11"/>For Your sake, our God, act!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/12"/>and not for our sake.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:dirshu_adonai_behimmatzo_qerauhu_bihyoto_qarov/13"/>See how we stand impoverished and empty.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
